{"id":"0d02dcc69684a5ea","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Metrizable Space","display":"df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Metrizable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Metrizable Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Metrizable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,X,\\tau\">\\(d,X,\\tau\\)</span> (parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Metric}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\)</span> (typing predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S\\)</span> (metric-topology predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The induced-topology predicate is defined explicitly by metric balls and is reused by downstream completely metrizable-space atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"d,X,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Metric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induced\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4MetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)","display":true}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"770948d5c2bf7204","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ and $\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)$ are as in [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3572","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space.md|58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["267957a097ff75bf","815e63e5071e7b58"]}